message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Rewiring-Collective-Action: agent-based model of guided network rewiring and consensus formation"
abstract: >-
  Agent-based model in which agents holding continuous opinions are embedded in a social
  network, used to analyse how rewiring strategies based on recommender algorithms
  (Who to Follow, node2vec, and topological heuristics) affect the speed and magnitude of
  consensus formation and depolarization.
